<title>USA: Medstone Intl Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Medstone Intl Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>ALISO VIEJO, Calif. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>MEDSTONE INTERNATIONAL INC.</p>
<p>		CONDENSED COMPARATIVE OPERATING RESULTS</p>
<p>	 For the three months ended    For the year ended</p>
<p>	  Dec. 31,	Dec. 31,	Dec. 31,	  Dec. 31,</p>
<p>		 1996	   1995	   1996		 1995</p>
