<p>(1)  Includes a $554,000 one-time gain from the sale of Endocare Inc. Common Stock. (2)  Includes revenue of $202,119 from Endocare that Medstone spun-out at the end of fiscal year 1995. (3)  Includes a $5,500,000 settlement expense and $769,000 of litigation costs. (4)  Includes revenue of $951,310 from Endocare that Medstone spun-out at the end of fiscal year 1995. (5)  Excluding the settlement expense, associated litigation costs and one-time gain from sale of Common Stock the fully diluted earnings per share would have been $0.63 per share.</p>
